    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31164" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴπου</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ
			που</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>if anywhere, if
				at all</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.93
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ τί που ἔστι</span>
			<i>if</i> it is <i>any way</i> possible, <i><span class="en">
				4.193
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάσας ξυνήθροισεν εἴ πού τις ἦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					2.1.10
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			indirect, <i>whether anywhere</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πευσόμενος . . εἴ που ἔτ᾽ εἴης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					13.415
				</span></i>
			, etc.</div>
